# Project Phoenix Master Task vNext

## Browser Game Ecosystem Complete Edition

**최종 목표:** The Operating System for Browser Games

> 누구나 게임을 만들고 · 친구와 플레이하고 · 성장하며 · 게임이 계속 올라오는 생태계

**경쟁 상대:** Roblox · Steam Workshop · Fortnite Creative (NOT Slither.io / Poki)

**판단 기준:** 생태계 성장에 기여하지 않는 기능은 추가하지 않는다.

---

## Product Boundary (절대 규칙)

**Replay = Browser Game Platform** (Steam + Poki + Slither + Roblox Creator + Discord Party)

**AI는 게임 플랫폼을 강화하는 데만 사용한다:**
게임 추천 · 친구 매칭 · 맵 밸런스 · 신규 게임 QA · 악성 댓글 · Creator 리뷰 · 리텐션 · 이벤트

**절대 Replay 메인 서비스가 아닌 것 (별도 SaaS):**
CEO Office · Company OS · Founder Memory · Company Score · Company Simulator · Decision Queue

**AI PM = Internal Admin only** (`/admin` 운영도구)
게임 상태 · 버그 · 평점 · 댓글 · 배포 · AI QA · 게임/Creator 승인 — 여기까지만.

**홈 = Player first:** 친구 플레이중 · Tournament · Continue · Quick Match · Mission · 추천 게임

---

## 개발 우선순위

```
P0 Platform Core → P1 Flagship MP → P2 Creator → P3 Growth/Viral → P4 Business → P5 AI → P6 Production
```

---

## P0 — Browser Game Engine

SDK가 아닌 **Browser Game Engine**. 게임은 `Replay.Engine.enable()` 끝.

Runtime · Save · Reward · Identity · Mission · Collection · Party · Friends · Voice · Tournament · Matchmaking · Balance · Moment · Leaderboard · AI Director · Analytics

---

## P1 — Flagship Multiplayer (Snake.io)

Slither + Agar + Brawl Stars + Fall Guys + Among Us + Vampire Survivors (좋은 점만)

- Biome: Forest · Ice · Lava · Ocean · Sky · Space · City
- Zone: Safe · Danger · Boss · Treasure · Portal · Fog
- Weather: Rain · Snow · Meteor · Storm · Night · Wind
- Day Cycle: Morning · Evening · Night
- Scale: 1P→100P (20=Festival · 50=Mega · 100=World Event)
- Boss: Dragon · Kraken · Titan Snake · Meteor Worm · King Food
- World Events: Golden Apple · Treasure Rain · Meteor · Black Hole · Double EXP · Food Storm · Portal · Boss Spawn · Team Battle · Survival

---

## P2–P6 (순서 고정, P0/P1 완성 후)

- P2: Universal MP (Golf · UNO · Bomber · Kart…) · Party/Friends/Guild 강화
- P3: Creator (AI Builder · No-Code · Marketplace · Revenue)
- P4: Growth (Notification · Calendar · Wrapped)
- P5: AI Ops (QA · Patch notes · PR Draft)
- P6: Developer Platform (AI/No-Code/Pro Studio · 승인→Publish)

---

## Definition of Done

**Player:** 종료→다음행동 · 홈=이유 먼저 · 공통 Engine  
**Multiplayer:** 2–100P 자동 · Party 유지 · Snake=대표게임  
**Creator:** AI/No-Code/Pro → Marketplace 원클릭  
**Ecosystem:** 게임↑=가치↑ · 개발자↑=콘텐츠↑ · 친구↑=재방문↑  
**Ops:** 5분 운영 · AI QA/패치노트  
**Business:** 다중 수익모델 · Creator+Platform 수익

